y drives  to the bikers he stops them and asks  them to go back to citadel which has  abundant water and food crops also the  place is unguarded now since joe and the  war boys have been in pursuit of them  furiosa thinks long and hard about it  but after she realizes that max is  correct she agrees soon the group rides  in the rig accompanied by the seeds on  their bikes joe sees the rig going  towards the canyon and realizes that  they are driving back to the citadel  since it's unguarded worried he  immediately tells his men to pursue the  rig after a bit of high speed chasing  the war boys finally catch up with  furyo's rig and a brutal war ensues  several of joe's men are killed but the  good guys also suffer casualties in the  form of the bikers furiosa is also  injured when a war boy jumps onto her  with a dagger with the war getting more  brutal by the minute furiosa and her  group somehow managed to get an upper  hand with the help of knox she manages  to get onto joe's rig the two then start  tussling in the moving vehicle but  furiosa eventually ends the fight when  she attaches joe's mask onto the wheels  taking his face off and killing him  instantly despite the leader being  killed the war boys are still fighting  with all their might just then knox who  is driving a large fuel tanker thinks of  a plan his entire life has been  unappreciated and assaulted so he wants  to perish with a good cause in short he  wants to help the innocent girls escape  from the tyranny of the war boys soon he  violently swerves his vehicle and  crashes against a rock a large explosion  occurs and it finally kills all of the  war boys sadly nux also loses his life  but it was a decision he had made long  ago elsewhere on the way to the citadel  furiosa becomes severely weak and  collapses as the other girls start  panicking max steps in he makes a small  cut underneath furios's lungs to help  her breathe when the plan doesn't work  he gives her a transfusion of his own  blood luckily the procedure works and  furiosa slowly opens her eyes soon the  group arrives at the citadel where max  reveals joe's mouthless corpse to the  people making everyone excited yeah [ __ ]  the war boys the people of the citadel  rip off joe's corpse as they are happy  that the tyrannical rule has finally  come to an end they then start shouting  to let furiosa and joe's wives inside  the cave as they are the real rulers  with the public support against them  joe's war boys reluctantly comply and  make the ladies their rulers as furiosa  and her group overlook the entire crowd  she notices max silently leaving the  place since his promise has now been  fulfilled he will venture to new lands  where other people are in need of help  the movie ends as an unlimited supply of  water is released from the cave sending  everyone into a state of frenzy  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

